The upstream project carries no license file. Copyright in the upstream
work remains with its authors -- the Reforged Team, including Fajeth,
Nauno and ThreeOfMe among others -- and nothing in this file grants,
transfers, or claims any right over their work.

The terms below apply ONLY to modifications and additions authored in
this repository and attributable to its contributors. If you need rights
to the upstream work, seek them from the upstream authors.

The Guild 2 and The Guild 2: Renaissance are the property of their
respective rights holders. This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan
modification and is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.


