NOTE ON TERMINOLOGY
-------------------

CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 is a free-culture-adjacent license but is NOT an
"open source" license as defined by the Open Source Initiative, because
the NonCommercial clause restricts a field of use. It is the right
choice when non-commercial use is the goal; it is simply not accurate to
call the result OSI open source.
